{
  "uid": "aveline-business",
  "title": "Aveline \u2014 Business metrics (the nineteen bridged series)",
  "description": "The nineteen Postgres business metrics bridged onto OTLP gauges by SystemMetricCollector. Postgres remains authoritative for history; these are the now-metrics. A gap is an omission, not a zero.",
